# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — CardDemo (COBOL → Java migration target)
# Stack: Java 25 LTS · Maven 3.9.9 · Spring Boot 3.5.11 · PostgreSQL 16 · Docker
#
# Purpose: keep the repository clean of build output, IDE metadata, OS cruft,
# logs, coverage/scan reports, and local secrets — while ALWAYS tracking the
# Maven wrapper scripts, the wrapper .properties, source, docs, migrations,
# config YAMLs, and the frozen COBOL reference corpus (app/, samples/).
#
# Conventions: plain text, one pattern per line, grouped with comment headers.
# A trailing "/" matches directories only; a leading "!" re-includes a path.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Maven build output ------------------------------------------------------
target/
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties
.mvn/timing.properties
# The Maven wrapper JAR is downloaded on first use, never committed
# (the wrapper scripts and maven-wrapper.properties ARE committed — see "Keep").
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# --- Compiled / packaged output ----------------------------------------------
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
# JVM crash / compiler-replay dumps
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# --- Test & coverage reports (JaCoCo / Surefire / Failsafe) ------------------
# JaCoCo execution data + HTML report. Surefire/Failsafe reports live under
# target/ and are therefore already ignored by the Maven build-output group.
*.exec
target/site/jacoco/

# --- IDE: IntelliJ IDEA -------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

# --- IDE: Eclipse -------------------------------------------------------------
.classpath
.project
.settings/
bin/

# --- IDE: Visual Studio Code --------------------------------------------------
.vscode/

# --- IDE: NetBeans ------------------------------------------------------------
nbproject/
nbbuild/
nbdist/

# --- Operating system files ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs & temporary files ---------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.tmp

# --- Local environment & secrets ---------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit credentials. LOCALSTACK_AUTH_TOKEN, the JWT signing secret, and
# AWS access keys MUST be supplied via environment variables / a secret manager.
.env
.env.local
*.local.env

# --- Docker / OWASP dependency-check -----------------------------------------
# OWASP dependency-check report(s) and its locally-cached CVE database.
dependency-check-report.*
dependency-check-data/

# --- Keep (explicitly tracked — must NOT be ignored) -------------------------
# Maven wrapper scripts have no extension, so *.jar never matches them; these
# negations document intent and guard against future broad patterns.
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties
# Allow a committed environment template while real .env files stay ignored.
!.env.example
